# Vendored ESP-IDF DHCP server

Source: components/lwip/apps/dhcpserver/dhcpserver.c
IDF version: 6.1.0
dhcpserver.c sha1: 4eba197c7fb2d76b

vendored_dhcps.c differs from upstream/dhcpserver.c only by:
  - renamed headers (guards __DHCPS_H__ -> __VENDORED_DHCPS_H__)
  - local fallbacks for MAX_STATION_NUM / LEASE_UNIT, which the IDF Kconfig
    removes when CONFIG_LWIP_DHCPS=n
  - static-lease support (see LEASES in the source)

Run:  diff -u upstream/dhcpserver.c vendored_dhcps.c
